 "note": "What each AI feature must show before it is switched on (p1-ai-language-s09). Every value is a design value chosen by the implementer from the plan's targets, awaiting the owner's review; a feature is enabled only when every suite below passes on the committed result files in reports/ai. A suite with no result file is SKIPPED, and SKIPPED never passes: the feature stays off. tools/eval/ai_gate.py writes content/ai/features.json from this file.",
